  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tier 2 Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">In PNG Australia helped the PNG Institute of Medical Research improve its internal systems and planning, increasing its ability to research effective interventions to prevent and control disease in PNG communities. Australian assistance included technical support to improve the Institute&#x2019;s internal governance, reform its financial, IT and staffing systems, develop a 10-year research plan and strengthen its relationships with partner institutions. These reforms mean that the Institute&apos;s operation is more sustainable and effective over the longer term, and will be able to continue conducting research and developing evidence for improvements to PNG&#x2019;s health system into the future.</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-07-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-06-30"></period-end>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result aggregation-status="0" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tier 2 Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Outbreak Alert and Response Network (GOARN) adviser increased the pool of public and allied health professionals able to deploy in response to disease outbreaks and strengthened professional health networks in the region through facilitating training for 156 individuals and adding nine new institutions to the GOARN network. The adviser supported 16 individuals to complete 24 GOARN deployments requested by six member states in the Western Pacific Region to support the COVID-19 response and supported the development of training activities and materials for the GOARN network.</narrative>
    </description>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-07-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-06-30"></period-end>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
